# ScriptPlayerActor: Temple Grounds 01_temple_hive03 (3bfa3eff) layer 2: e001100e6 "Samus" (flags 0xC:
# 0x8 = count the area's loading player actors, 0x4). The layer switch sends AreaLoaded with the area
# tracking arm; Activate, the load finishes (Arrived, count back down), Deactivate.
@f260 layer 2
@f300 god 1
@f320 obj e001100e6
@f340 send e001100e6 Activate
@f700 obj e001100e6
@f900 send e001100e6 Deactivate
@f920 send e001100e6 Activate
@f1300 send e001100e6 Delete
